OL,3,GNEWSARegeneration plans unveiled for
OL,4,Atwo town centres
OL,5,
OL,6,FLong-term plans aimed at reshaping the
OL,7,Fcentres of two Northamptonshire towns
OL,8,Fare due to be considered by councillors
OL,9,Fin the coming days.
OL,11,FWest Northamptonshire Council's cabinet
OL,12,Fwill discuss masterplans for
OL,13,FNorthampton and Daventry on Tuesday,
OL,14,Fsetting out ambitions to attract
OL,15,Finvestment and improve the look and
OL,16,Ffeel of both town centres.
OL,18,FThe new plan for Northampton aims to
OL,19,Fcreate a more walkable and
OL,20,Fbetter-connected town, with new
OL,21,Fneighbourhoods.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
