OL,3,GNEWSARegeneration plans unveiled for
OL,4,Atwo town centres
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor Daventry, the regeneration plans
OL,7,Finclude a new play attraction and
OL,8,Ffamily-focused leisure facilities at
OL,9,FNew Street Recreation Ground.
